flowchart TD
    A[HOD Login<br/>/login?role=hod] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid| C[Department Portal: /hod]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D[Load Department Context<br/>GET /api/hod/department]
    D --> E[Display Department Info<br/>Name, Student Count, Faculty Count]
    E --> F{HOD Dashboard Tabs}

    %% Live Roster Flow
    F -->|Click Live Roster Tab| G1[Department Roster<br/>/hod/roster]
    G1 --> H1[Load All Department Members<br/>GET /api/hod/roster]
    H1 --> I1[Filter Bar<br/>Role, Year, Status]
    I1 --> J1[Display Grid<br/>Students & Faculty Cards]
    J1 --> K1{Filter by}
    K1 -->|All| L1[Show All]
    K1 -->|Present| L2[Show Currently On-Campus]
    K1 -->|Absent| L3[Show Currently Off-Campus]
    J1 --> M1[Click Person Card]
    M1 --> N1[Person Detail Modal<br/>Photo, Info, Current Status]
    N1 --> O1{Modal Actions}
    O1 -->|View History| P1[Entry/Exit Timeline]
    O1 -->|Generate Pass| P2[Create Pass Form]

    %% Pass Approvals Flow
    F -->|Click Approvals Tab| G2[Pass Approvals<br/>/hod/approvals]
    G2 --> H2[Load Pending Passes<br/>GET /api/hod/approvals/pending]
    H2 --> I2[Approval Cards<br/>Student Name, Pass Type, Date]
    I2 --> J2{Click Pass Card}
    J2 --> K2[Pass Detail Modal]
    K2 --> L2[Display<br/>Student Details, Pass Reason, Dates]
    L2 --> M2{Approval Buttons}
    M2 -->|Approve| N2[Enter Comments -> Click Approve]
    N2 --> O2[POST /api/passes/:id/approve]
    O2 --> P3[Pass Approved -> Notify Student & Parent]
    P3 --> Q1[Approval Logged]
    Q1 --> H2
    
    M2 -->|Reject| N3[Enter Rejection Reason]
    N3 --> O3[POST /api/passes/:id/reject]
    O3 --> P4[Student Notified]
    P4 --> Q2[Refresh List]
    Q2 --> H2
    
    M2 -->|Request More Info| N4[Add Comment]
    N4 --> O4[POST /api/passes/:id/comment]
    O4 --> P5[Comment Sent to Student]
    P5 --> Q2

    %% Bulk Pass Generation Flow
    F -->|Click Bulk Passes| G3[Field Trip / Event Passes<br/>/hod/bulk-pass]
    G3 --> H3[Create Bulk Pass Form]
    H3 --> I3[Select Students<br/>Checkbox Multi-Select]
    I3 --> J3[Enter Trip Details<br/>Destination, Date, Purpose]
    J3 --> K3[Set Return Deadline]
    K3 --> L3[Click Generate Passes]
    L3 --> M3[POST /api/passes/bulk-create]
    M3 --> N5[Bulk Passes Generated]
    N5 --> O5[Passes Sent to Students]
    O5 --> P6[Download Pass List PDF]

    %% Duty Leave Management Flow
    F -->|Click Duty Leave Tab| G4[Faculty Duty Leave<br/>/hod/duty-leave]
    G4 --> H4[Load Faculty Leave Requests<br/>GET /api/hod/duty-leave]
    H4 --> I4[Faculty Leave Cards]
    I4 --> J4{Click Leave Request}
    J4 --> K4[Leave Detail Modal<br/>Faculty, Dates, Event/Conference]
    K4 --> L4{Decision}
    L4 -->|Approve| M4[Click Approve]
    M4 --> N6[POST /api/duty-leave/:id/approve]
    N6 --> O6[Notify Faculty]
    O6 --> P7[HR Updated]
    P7 --> H4
    
    L4 -->|Reject| M5[Enter Reason]
    M5 --> N7[POST /api/duty-leave/:id/reject]
    N7 --> P8[Faculty Notified]
    P8 --> H4

    %% Analytics & Reports Flow
    F -->|Click Analytics Tab| G5[Department Analytics<br/>/hod/analytics]
    G5 --> H5[Load Analytics Data<br/>GET /api/hod/analytics]
    H5 --> I5[Dashboard Grid]
    I5 --> J5{View Metrics}
    J5 -->|Attendance Trends| K5[Line Chart: Daily Attendance %]
    K5 --> L5[Filter: Last 7/30/90 Days]
    
    J5 -->|Defaulter List| K6[Table: Students Below Threshold]
    K6 --> L6[Export Defaulters PDF]
    L6 --> M6[Click Download]
    
    J5 -->|Curfew Breaches| K7[Bar Chart: Curfew Violations by Hostel]
    K7 --> L7[Click Student -> View Details]
    
    J5 -->|Pass Usage| K8[Pie Chart: Pass Types Used]
    K8 --> L8[Monthly Breakdown]

    %% Export Report Flow
    F -->|Click Export Tab| G6[Export Reports<br/>/hod/export]
    G6 --> H6[Report Templates]
    H6 --> I6{Select Template}
    I6 -->|Attendance Report| J6[Select Date Range & Class]
    J6 --> K9[Click Generate]
    K9 --> L9[GET /api/reports/attendance]
    L9 --> M7[Download Excel]
    
    I6 -->|Department Movement| J7[Select Period]
    J7 --> K10[GET /api/reports/movement]
    K10 --> M8[Download PDF]

    %% Notifications Flow
    C --> X[Bell Icon]
    X --> Y[Notification Dropdown]
    Y --> Z[Notifications List<br/>Pass Approvals, Alerts, Announcements]
    Z --> A1{Click Notification}
    A1 -->|Pass Request| B1[Navigate to Approvals Tab]
    A1 -->|Defaulter Alert| B2[Navigate to Analytics Defaulter View]

    %% Settings Flow
    F -->|Click Settings Tab| G7[HOD Settings<br/>/hod/settings]
    G7 --> H7[Settings Form]
    H7 --> I7[Configure Auto-Approval Rules]
    I7 --> J9[Save Settings]
    J9 --> K11[PATCH /api/hod/settings]
    K11 --> L10[Success Toast]

    %% Logout Flow
    C --> V1[Profile -> Logout]
    V1 --> V2[POST /api/auth/logout]
    V2 --> V3[Clear Session]
    V3 --> A